{
  "meta": {
    "title": "Hono v5 RC 検証結果",
    "measuredAt": "2026-10-18",
    "env": {
      "node": "v24.22.0",
      "typescript": "7.0.2",
      "tsx": "4.23.15",
      "machine": "Apple M4 (arm64), macOS Darwin 25.5.0"
    },
    "versions": {
      "v4": "hono@4.13.13",
      "v5": "hono@5.0.0-rc.1",
      "adapter": "@hono/bun@1.0.1"
    },
    "note": "v5 は RC 版。正式リリース時に挙動が変わる可能性がある。ベンチは app.fetch() によるインプロセス計測で、実 HTTP サーバーや Workers 本番の性能ではない。",
    "sources": [
      "https://hono.dev/docs/guides/migrating-to-v5"
    ]
  },
  "experiment1_typeSafety": {
    "description": "c.req.json() / c.req.query() の型変更を tsc --strict で検証",
    "command": "npx tsc --noEmit --strict --module NodeNext --moduleResolution NodeNext --target ES2022 src/<file>.ts",
    "results": {
      "typecheck-json": {
        "v4": {
          "passed": true,
          "output": []
        },
        "v5": {
          "passed": false,
          "output": [
            "src/typecheck-json.ts(9,11): error TS18046: 'body' is of type 'unknown'."
          ]
        }
      },
      "typecheck-query": {
        "v4": {
          "passed": true,
          "output": []
        },
        "v5": {
          "passed": false,
          "output": [
            "src/typecheck-query.ts(7,25): error TS18048: 'name' is possibly 'undefined'.",
            "src/typecheck-query.ts(10,9): error TS2322: Type 'string[] | undefined' is not assignable to type 'string[]'.",
            "  Type 'undefined' is not assignable to type 'string[]'."
          ]
        }
      },
      "typecheck-guard": {
        "v4": {
          "passed": true,
          "output": []
        },
        "v5": {
          "passed": true,
          "output": []
        }
      },
      "typecheck-onerror-v4style": {
        "v4": {
          "passed": true,
          "output": []
        },
        "v5": {
          "passed": false,
          "output": [
            "src/typecheck-onerror-v4style.ts(7,21): error TS2339: Property 'message' does not exist on type 'Context<BlankEnv, string, any>'.",
            "src/typecheck-onerror-v4style.ts(8,12): error TS2339: Property 'json' does not exist on type 'Next'."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "verdict": "v4 は 4 件すべて型エラーなし。v5 は json / query / v4スタイルonError が型エラーになり、型ガード版のみ通過。 v4スタイルの onError は型エラーで捕まるため、tsc を通していれば移行時に気づける。"
  },
  "experiment2_runtimeBehavior": {
    "v4": {
      "onError_path_arg": {
        "accepted": false,
        "error": "this.errorHandler is not a function"
      },
      "onError_composition": {
        "order": [
          "second"
        ],
        "status": 500,
        "body": "second"
      },
      "throw_string": {
        "escaped": true,
        "escapedValue": "oops",
        "seen": null
      },
      "throw_object": {
        "escaped": true,
        "escapedValue": "{\"code\":42}",
        "seen": null
      },
      "notFound_path_arg": {
        "accepted": true,
        "status": 500,
        "body": "Internal Server Error"
      },
      "json_undefined": {
        "status": 200,
        "bodyLength": 0
      },
      "json_function": {
        "status": 200,
        "body": ""
      },
      "query_runtime": {
        "q": {
          "a": "1"
        },
        "qs": {
          "a": [
            "1",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "v5": {
      "onError_path_arg": {
        "accepted": true,
        "api": {
          "status": 500,
          "header": "api",
          "body": {
            "error": "Internal Server Error"
          }
        },
        "other": {
          "status": 500,
          "header": null,
          "body": {
            "error": "Internal Server Error"
          }
        }
      },
      "onError_composition": {
        "order": [
          "first",
          "second"
        ],
        "status": 500,
        "body": "second"
      },
      "onError_first_returns": {
        "order": [
          "first"
        ],
        "status": 500,
        "body": "first"
      },
      "onError_v4_style": {
        "observed": {
          "firstArgCtor": "Context",
          "firstArgIsContext": true,
          "secondArgType": "function"
        },
        "threw": true,
        "message": "Context is not finalized. Did you forget to return a Response object or `await next()`?"
      },
      "throw_string": {
        "escaped": false,
        "status": 500,
        "seen": {
          "ctor": "Error",
          "message": "oops",
          "cause": "oops"
        }
      },
      "throw_object": {
        "escaped": false,
        "status": 500,
        "seen": {
          "ctor": "Error",
          "message": "",
          "cause": {
            "code": 42
          }
        }
      },
      "notFound_path_arg": {
        "accepted": true,
        "api": {
          "status": 404,
          "header": "api",
          "body": "API resource not found"
        },
        "other": {
          "status": 404,
          "header": null,
          "body": "Not Found"
        }
      },
      "json_undefined": {
        "status": 500,
        "bodyLength": 21
      },
      "json_function": {
        "status": 500,
        "body": "Internal Server Error"
      },
      "query_runtime": {
        "q": {
          "a": "1"
        },
        "qs": {
          "a": [
            "1",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  },
